# Candy Lane, Wonka 03.03's own mode, changed (PAD-1351).  Every key: tools/jjp_emu/MODES.md
# Proven in the emulator: the game's 30 s became 60 s, its awards three times as big,
# the upper-left flipper target no longer counts for it, and the right ramp counts as
# the TV target while it runs.
mode = cl_mode
seconds = 60
points_x = 3
shots_off = target_ul_flipper
shots_add = switch_ramp_right_made:target_tv
